abstract: >-
  Exact stream-dual upper certificates and residual-capacity screening
  yield a rigorous bracket of width below 0.01 for the two-bidder,
  two-item independent-uniform pointwise-DSIC auction. An explicit
  randomized mechanism has revenue 0.875819854148422455346... and earns
  at least 98.8779% of unrestricted optimal revenue. New full randomized
  conditional supports at diagonal holes and lottery junctions guide
  jointly feasible menu changes with exact algebraic/logarithmic gains.
  Independent audits reconstruct the new additions while retaining the
  historical exact reference integral. The unrestricted optimum and a
  matching common capacity support remain open.
